#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:4
msgid "Population-Based Training"
msgstr "基于种群的训练"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:6
msgid ""
"Population-based training (PBT) is an online optimization loop around "
"regular reinforcement learning (RL) training. Instead of choosing one set of"
" hyperparameters and training one policy, PBT trains a population of "
"independent policies on the same task. It periodically ranks them by a task-"
"level objective. An underperforming learner copies a promising learner's "
"checkpoint, mutates selected hyperparameters, and continues training from "
"the copied weights."
msgstr ""
"基于种群的训练（PBT）是在常规强化学习（RL）训练外层运行的在线优化循环。它不只选择一组超参数、训练一个策略，而是在同一任务上训练一组独立策略，并定期根据任务级目标排序。表现不佳的学习器会复制有潜力的学习器检查点，变异所选超参数，再从复制的权重继续训练。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:12
msgid "This cycle combines two ideas:"
msgstr "这一循环结合了两种思路："

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Explore:** different seeds and hyperparameters let the learners discover "
"different behaviors."
msgstr "**探索：** 不同种子和超参数使学习器发现不同的行为。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Exploit:** checkpoint replacement redirects compute from stalled learners "
"to behaviors that are already working."
msgstr "**利用：** 替换检查点，将计算资源从停滞的学习器转向已有效的行为。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:17
msgid ""
"Unlike a fixed random or grid search, PBT can change hyperparameters during "
"training and reuse the weights from a successful run. The final artifact is "
"still a normal policy checkpoint; PBT changes how it is trained, not how it "
"is deployed."
msgstr ""
"与固定的随机搜索或网格搜索不同，PBT 可以在训练中改变超参数，并复用成功运行的权重。最终产物仍是普通策略检查点；PBT 改变训练方式，不改变部署方式。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you are new to RL workflows in Isaac Lab, first read :ref:`tutorial-run-"
"rl-training` and :ref:`tutorial-configure-rl-training`."
msgstr ""
"如果刚开始使用 Isaac Lab 的强化学习流程，请先阅读 :ref:`tutorial-run-rl-training` 和 "
":ref:`tutorial-configure-rl-training` 。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:28
msgid "Isaac Lab currently supports PBT only with the **RL-Games** library."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 目前仅在 **RL-Games** 库中支持 PBT。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:32
msgid "When to Use PBT"
msgstr "何时使用 PBT"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:34
msgid "PBT is most useful when:"
msgstr "PBT 尤其适用于："

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:36
msgid ""
"independent seeds frequently converge to very different results or stall in "
"local optima;"
msgstr "不同种子经常收敛到差异很大的结果，或停留在局部最优；"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:37
msgid ""
"a task has a stable scalar success metric that can rank policies while they "
"train;"
msgstr "任务具有稳定的标量成功指标，可在训练期间对策略排序；"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:38
msgid ""
"useful hyperparameters may need different values in early and late training;"
" and"
msgstr "有用的超参数在训练早期和后期可能需要不同值；以及"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:39
msgid "enough compute is available to train several policies concurrently."
msgstr "有足够计算资源并发训练多个策略。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:41
msgid ""
"Start with ordinary single-policy training when a known configuration "
"converges reliably, when compute only supports one or two runs, or when "
"policies cannot be compared with a meaningful objective. PBT adds checkpoint"
" I/O and coordination overhead, and a population of *N* learners consumes "
"approximately the aggregate compute of *N* ordinary runs. A fair experiment "
"therefore compares PBT with the same number of independent fixed-"
"configuration runs, not with one run."
msgstr ""
"如果已知配置能够可靠收敛、计算资源只支持一两次运行，或无法通过有意义的目标比较策略，应先使用普通单策略训练。PBT 增加检查点 I/O 和协调开销，包含"
" *N* 个学习器的种群约消耗 *N* 次普通运行的总计算量。因此，公平实验应将 PBT 与相同数量的独立固定配置运行比较，而非只与一次运行比较。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:47
msgid ""
"PBT is also different from :doc:`multi-GPU training "
"</source/features/multi_gpu>`. Distributed data-parallel training uses "
"several devices to update one policy. PBT gives each learner its own policy,"
" optimizer state, experience, and checkpoint, and only exchanges checkpoints"
" during selection."
msgstr ""
"PBT 也不同于 :doc:`多 GPU 训练 </source/features/multi_gpu>` "
"。分布式数据并行训练使用多个设备更新一个策略；PBT 中各学习器拥有自己的策略、优化器状态、经验和检查点，仅在选择阶段交换检查点。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:53
msgid "Example Where PBT Was Enabling"
msgstr "PBT 使任务得以解决的示例"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:55
msgid ""
"The `DexPBT study`_ tested contact-rich manipulation tasks with large "
"observation and action spaces, sparse task success, and many locally useful "
"behaviors that did not lead to a complete solution. For its PBT-versus-PPO "
"comparison, the authors held aggregate compute constant: the best learner in"
" an eight-policy PBT population was compared with the best of eight "
"independent PPO seeds, with every learner trained for five billion "
"environment steps."
msgstr ""
"`DexPBT study`_ 测试了多接触操作任务，其观测和动作空间较大、任务成功稀疏，且存在许多局部有效但无法完成整个任务的行为。在 PBT 与 "
"PPO 的对比中，作者保持总计算量相同：将八策略 PBT 种群中的最佳学习器，与八个独立 PPO 种子中的最佳结果比较，每个学习器都训练五十亿个环境步。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:61
msgid ""
"Single-arm object reorientation comparison reported in Figure 4 of the "
"`DexPBT study`_"
msgstr "`DexPBT study`_ 图 4 中报告的单臂物体重定向对比"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:65
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "条件"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:66
msgid "Training behavior"
msgstr "训练行为"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:67
msgid "Outcome under the study budget"
msgstr "研究预算内的结果"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:68
msgid "PPO without PBT"
msgstr "不使用 PBT 的 PPO"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:69
msgid ""
"Eight policies trained independently with fixed hyperparameters; discoveries"
" were not shared."
msgstr "八个策略使用固定超参数独立训练，不共享发现。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:70
msgid "None of the eight runs reached the final 1 cm success tolerance."
msgstr "八次运行均未达到最终 1 cm 的成功容差。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:71
msgid "PPO with PBT"
msgstr "使用 PBT 的 PPO"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:72
msgid ""
"Eight learners periodically shared promising weights and explored mutated "
"hyperparameters."
msgstr "八个学习器定期共享有潜力的权重，并探索变异后的超参数。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:73
msgid ""
"The population reached the final tolerance and continued improving the "
"number of consecutive successes."
msgstr "种群达到最终容差，并继续提高连续成功次数。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:75
msgid ""
"The study reported improvement in every tested scenario and found PBT to be "
"an enabling factor for non-trivial performance in three of them. In the "
"harder dual-arm reorientation task, its best PBT policy reached almost 40 of"
" 50 consecutive successes. See the paper's `training curves`_ and "
"`supplementary policy videos`_ for the full comparison and learned "
"behaviors."
msgstr ""
"该研究在每个测试场景中都观察到改善，并发现 PBT 是其中三个场景获得有效性能的关键因素。在更困难的双臂重定向任务中，最佳 PBT 策略在 50 "
"次尝试中实现近 40 次连续成功。完整对比和学得的行为见论文的 `training curves`_ 和 `supplementary policy "
"videos`_ 。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:80
msgid ""
"No task mathematically requires PBT. Here, \"enabling\" means that fixed PPO"
" did not solve the task within the tested budget while PBT did. These "
"experiments used the Isaac Gym DexPBT tasks; they motivate the Isaac Lab "
"workflow below but are not benchmark results for the included Shadow Hand "
"example."
msgstr ""
"没有任务在数学上必须使用 PBT。这里“使任务得以解决”是指：在测试预算内，固定 PPO 没有解决任务，而 PBT 解决了。这些实验使用 Isaac "
"Gym DexPBT 任务，为下述 Isaac Lab 工作流程提供依据，但不是随附 Shadow Hand 示例的基准结果。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:86
msgid "How Isaac Lab Selects Policies"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 如何选择策略"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:88
msgid ""
"Every ``interval_steps``, each learner saves its checkpoint and current "
"objective to a shared workspace. For the initialized policies, let the "
"objective mean and standard deviation be :math:`\\mu` and :math:`\\sigma`. "
"Isaac Lab computes the leader and underperformer cuts as:"
msgstr ""
"每隔 ``interval_steps`` ，各学习器将检查点和当前目标值保存到共享工作目录。对于已初始化的策略，设目标均值和标准差为 "
":math:`\\mu` 和 :math:`\\sigma` 。Isaac Lab 按以下公式计算领先者和表现不佳者的阈值："

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:92
msgid "U = \\max(\\mu + \\mathtt{threshold\\_std}\\,\\sigma,\\ \\mu + \\mathtt{threshold\\_abs})"
msgstr "U = \\max(\\mu + \\mathtt{threshold\\_std}\\,\\sigma,\\ \\mu + \\mathtt{threshold\\_abs})"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:96
msgid "L = \\min(\\mu - \\mathtt{threshold\\_std}\\,\\sigma,\\ \\mu - \\mathtt{threshold\\_abs})"
msgstr "L = \\min(\\mu - \\mathtt{threshold\\_std}\\,\\sigma,\\ \\mu - \\mathtt{threshold\\_abs})"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:100
msgid ""
"Policies with an objective greater than :math:`U` are leaders; policies "
"below :math:`L` are underperformers. Only an underperformer is changed. It "
"copies a randomly selected leader and mutates each whitelisted "
"hyperparameter with probability ``mutation_rate``. If there is no leader, it"
" keeps its own checkpoint and mutates its hyperparameters. All other "
"policies continue unchanged."
msgstr ""
"目标值高于 :math:`U` 的策略为领先者，低于 :math:`L` 的为表现不佳者。只修改后者：随机复制一个领先者，并以 "
"``mutation_rate`` 的概率变异每个白名单超参数。如果没有领先者，则保留自身检查点并变异超参数。其他策略保持原状继续训练。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:105
msgid ""
"The learners coordinate through checkpoint and YAML metadata files rather "
"than a central process. They may progress asynchronously: a learner compares"
" checkpoints from the latest PBT iteration available at or before its own. "
"Every learner must still use the same ``num_policies`` and must see the "
"shared directory at the same absolute path because checkpoint paths stored "
"in the metadata are absolute."
msgstr ""
"学习器通过检查点和 YAML 元数据文件协调，无需中央进程。它们可以异步推进：各学习器比较不晚于自身 PBT "
"迭代的最新可用检查点。所有学习器仍必须使用相同的 ``num_policies`` "
"，并通过相同绝对路径访问共享目录，因为元数据中的检查点路径为绝对路径。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:112
msgid "Choose the Ranking Objective"
msgstr "选择排序目标"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:114
msgid ""
"The objective controls selection pressure, so choose a metric that measures "
"the behavior you ultimately want and is comparable across the population. "
"Higher values are always considered better. A task-success metric is usually"
" more suitable than a dense shaped reward whose scale changes during "
"training."
msgstr ""
"目标决定选择压力，应选择能衡量最终期望行为、且种群内可比较的指标，值越高始终视为越好。任务成功指标通常比训练中尺度变化的密集塑形奖励更适合。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:118
msgid "The included reorientation configuration uses:"
msgstr "随附的重定向配置使用："

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:124
msgid ""
"This dotted path resolves to "
"``infos[\"episode\"][\"consecutive_successes\"]``. The RL-Games wrapper "
"remaps ``extras[\"log\"]`` to ``infos[\"episode\"]``, so use the "
"``episode.`` prefix even when the environment writes the metric to "
"``extras[\"log\"]``."
msgstr ""
"该点分隔路径解析为 ``infos[\"episode\"][\"consecutive_successes\"]`` 。RL-Games 包装器将 "
"``extras[\"log\"]`` 映射到 ``infos[\"episode\"]`` ，因此即使环境将指标写入 "
"``extras[\"log\"]`` ，也应使用 ``episode.`` 前缀。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:128
msgid ""
"Before a long run, verify that the objective is present, scalar, and "
"increases when policy behavior improves. A noisy or non-stationary objective"
" can repeatedly replace useful policies. PBT population members also stop "
"being independent after checkpoint exchange, so evaluate the selected "
"checkpoint separately across held-out seeds and conditions."
msgstr ""
"长时间运行前，确认目标存在、为标量，且策略行为改善时会增大。噪声较大或非平稳的目标可能反复替换有效策略。检查点交换后，PBT "
"种群成员也不再独立，因此应在留出的种子和条件下单独评估所选检查点。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:135
msgid "Configure PBT"
msgstr "配置 PBT"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:137
msgid ""
"The ``Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Shadow-Direct`` RL-Games configuration provides a "
"complete PBT example. PBT is disabled by default; the launch command in the "
"next section enables it."
msgstr ""
"``Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Shadow-Direct`` 的 RL-Games 配置提供了完整 PBT 示例。PBT "
"默认关闭，下一节的启动命令会启用它。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:144
msgid "The main controls are:"
msgstr "主要设置如下："

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:146
msgid "``directory`` and ``workspace``"
msgstr "``directory`` 和 ``workspace``"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:147
msgid ""
"Identify the shared storage root and the PBT run within that root. Use a new"
" workspace for each population."
msgstr "指定共享存储根目录，以及根目录内的 PBT 运行位置。每个种群应使用新工作目录。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:149
msgid "``num_policies`` and ``policy_idx``"
msgstr "``num_policies`` 和 ``policy_idx``"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:150
msgid "Define the population size and this learner's unique zero-based index."
msgstr "定义种群大小和当前学习器唯一的零起始索引。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:152
msgid "``objective``"
msgstr "``objective``"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:153
msgid ""
"Selects the scalar from the environment info dictionary used to rank "
"learners."
msgstr "从环境信息字典中选择用于学习器排序的标量。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:155
msgid "``interval_steps``"
msgstr "``interval_steps``"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:156
msgid ""
"Sets the number of environment steps between checkpoint comparisons. Shorter"
" intervals react sooner but cause more checkpoint I/O and give a mutated "
"learner less time to adapt."
msgstr "设置检查点比较之间的环境步数。间隔更短，响应更早，但检查点 I/O 更多，变异后的学习器适应时间也更少。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:159
msgid "``threshold_std`` and ``threshold_abs``"
msgstr "``threshold_std`` 和 ``threshold_abs``"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:160
msgid ""
"Control how far a policy must be from the population mean to be classified "
"as a leader or underperformer. If no policy crosses both effective margins, "
"the population continues without replacement."
msgstr "控制策略偏离种群均值多少才归类为领先者或表现不佳者。如果没有策略同时越过两个有效边界，种群继续运行，不进行替换。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:163
msgid "``mutation_rate``, ``change_range``, and ``mutation``"
msgstr "``mutation_rate`` 、 ``change_range`` 和 ``mutation``"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:164
msgid ""
"Control which hyperparameters may change and how often. ``mutate_float`` "
"multiplies or divides by a random factor in ``change_range``; "
"``mutate_discount`` conservatively changes the distance from 1.0 for "
"discount-like values. Parameters absent from ``mutation`` remain fixed."
msgstr ""
"控制哪些超参数可改变，以及改变频率。 ``mutate_float`` 乘以或除以 ``change_range`` 中的随机因子； "
"``mutate_discount`` 保守地改变折扣类值与 1.0 的距离。未包含在 ``mutation`` 中的参数保持固定。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:170
msgid "Launch the Population"
msgstr "启动种群"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:172
msgid ""
"Start one process per policy. The example below launches policy 0 of the "
"default eight-policy population. Run it in eight terminals or scheduler "
"jobs, changing only ``PBT_POLICY_IDX`` from 0 through 7. Keep "
"``PBT_NUM_POLICIES``, ``PBT_DIRECTORY``, and ``agent.pbt.workspace`` "
"identical for every process."
msgstr ""
"为每个策略启动一个进程。下例启动默认八策略种群中的策略 0。在八个终端或调度器作业中运行，只将 ``PBT_POLICY_IDX`` 从 0 改到 "
"7。各进程的 ``PBT_NUM_POLICIES`` 、 ``PBT_DIRECTORY`` 和 ``agent.pbt.workspace`` "
"保持一致。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:192
msgid ""
"Assign each process a GPU with your scheduler or ``CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`` "
"when running several workers on one host. Weights & Biases tracking is "
"optional; if enabled, give each worker a unique run name while keeping the "
"same project."
msgstr ""
"同一主机上运行多个工作进程时，通过调度器或 ``CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`` 为各进程分配 GPU。Weights & Biases "
"跟踪可选；启用时，各进程使用唯一运行名称，但保留相同项目。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:196
msgid ""
"During training, each policy writes numbered ``.pth`` checkpoints and "
"matching ``.yaml`` metadata under its policy directory in the shared "
"workspace. The metadata records the objective and mutated parameter values. "
"At the end of the run, select the checkpoint with the best validated "
"objective, then evaluate it as a normal RL-Games policy."
msgstr ""
"训练期间，各策略在共享工作目录内的策略目录下写入编号 ``.pth`` 检查点及对应的 ``.yaml`` "
"元数据，记录目标值和变异参数。运行结束后，选择经过验证、目标值最佳的检查点，再按普通 RL-Games 策略评估。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:202
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:204
msgid ""
"**No policies are replaced:** the population may not yet have crossed the "
"configured margins. Inspect the objectives before reducing the thresholds; "
"identical low scores can also mean the ranking metric is uninformative."
msgstr "**没有策略被替换：** 种群可能尚未越过配置的边界。减小阈值前先检查目标值；相同的低分也可能表示排序指标无法提供有效信息。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:206
msgid ""
"**An objective lookup fails:** verify the dotted path against the keys "
"emitted in ``infos[\"episode\"]``."
msgstr "**目标查找失败：** 根据 ``infos[\"episode\"]`` 输出的键核对点分隔路径。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:207
msgid ""
"**Workers cannot load one another's checkpoints:** confirm that every worker"
" uses the same absolute shared path, workspace name, and population size."
msgstr "**工作进程无法加载其他进程的检查点：** 确认各进程使用相同的共享绝对路径、工作目录名称和种群大小。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:209
msgid ""
"**Training spends too much time checkpointing:** increase ``interval_steps``"
" or place the workspace on faster shared storage."
msgstr "**保存检查点耗时过多：** 增大 ``interval_steps`` ，或将工作目录放到更快的共享存储上。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:214
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考文献"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:216
msgid ""
"Jaderberg et al., `Population Based Training of Neural Networks`_ (2017)."
msgstr "Jaderberg 等， `Population Based Training of Neural Networks`_ （2017）。"

#: source/features/population_based_training.rst:217
msgid ""
"Petrenko et al., `DexPBT: Scaling up Dexterous Manipulation for Hand-Arm "
"Systems with Population Based Training`_ (2023)."
msgstr ""
"Petrenko 等， `DexPBT: Scaling up Dexterous Manipulation for Hand-Arm Systems "
"with Population Based Training`_ （2023）。"
